{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "8c78100d-3fa9-410e-b0bf-8cadc1824628",
    "name": "Food Delivery API",
    "description": "# 🍔 Food Delivery Microservices API\n\nWelcome to the official Postman collection for the **Food Delivery Microservices Platform**.\n\n---\n\n## 🧪 Automated Collection Runner Ready\nThis collection is specially configured to pass **100% of tests** when executed with **Postman Collection Runner** in top-down sequence.\n\n### 🏷️ Test-Prefixed Data Isolation:\nTo clearly distinguish test runs in the database, all generated test data has the `TEST -` prefix:\n- **Users**: `firstName: \"TEST - Ozan\"`, `email: \"test_admin_<timestamp>@delivery.com\"`\n- **Addresses**: `title: \"TEST - Home Address\"`, `address: \"TEST - 123 Main Street, Apt 4B\"`\n- **Restaurants**: `name: \"TEST - Burger King Central\"`, `description: \"TEST - Delicious flame-grilled burgers...\"`\n- **Menu Items**: `name: \"TEST - Whopper Meal\"`, `category: \"TEST - Burgers\"`\n- **Orders**: `specialInstructions: \"TEST - Please do not ring the doorbell, baby is sleeping.\"`\n- **Couriers**: `firstName: \"TEST - John\"`, `email: \"test_courier_<timestamp>@delivery.com\"`\n\n---\n\n## 🔑 Dynamic Environment Variables\n- `baseUrl`: `http://localhost:3000` (API Gateway)\n- `token`: Bearer access token\n- `refreshToken`: Refresh token for obtaining new access tokens\n- `userId`: Authenticated user's ID\n- `restaurantId`: ID of the newly created restaurant\n- `menuItemId`: ID of the newly created menu item\n- `orderId`: ID of the newly created order",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "57587615"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth Service",
      "description": "User lifecycle, JWT authentication, tokens, profiles, and delivery addresses.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Register (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "// Generate unique TEST email to ensure Register always succeeds in Collection Runner",
                  "var timestamp = Date.now();",
                  "var uniqueEmail = 'test_admin_' + timestamp + '@delivery.com';",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userEmail', uniqueEmail);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('userPassword', 'password123');"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Register returns 201 Created', function () {",
                  "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test('Response contains tokens and TEST user data', function () {",
                  "    var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(res.status).to.eql('success');",
                  "    pm.expect(res.result).to.be.an('object');",
                  "    pm.expect(res.result.data.accessToken).to.be.a('string');",
                  "    pm.expect(res.result.data.user.firstName).to.eql('TEST - Ozan');",
                  "    ",
                  "    // Set Collection Variables for subsequent requests",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.result.data.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.result.data.refreshToken);",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', res.result.data.user.id);",
                  "    console.log('✅ Registered TEST User ID:', res.result.data.user.id);",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n    \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\",\n    \"firstName\": \"TEST - Ozan\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Demircan\",\n    \"phone\": \"+12125550199\",\n    \"role\": \"admin\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "### 👤 Register User\nRegisters a new Admin account with `TEST -` prefixed data and a unique timestamped email."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Login",
